        <p style="margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 10pt;">Based on the foregoing votes, each of Clifford Starke, Sammy Dorf, Edward Woo, Manfred Leventhal and Harold Wolkin were elected to the Company's Board, and Proposals 2, 3, 5 and 6 were approved. Proposal 4 was not approved. No other proposals were submitted for shareholder approval at the Annual Meeting.<b>&#160;</b></p>
